  "description": "<div class=\"image-with-text__text image-with-text__text--colored typeset rte\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Megi Wellness is an advanced, fortifying haircare line for hair that is&nbsp;<strong>thinning, losing volume and density</strong>.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Gentle, but powerful formulations that nourish the hair follicle, strengthen hair and help reduce hair fallout and breakage.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">We use the latest science. Our products are supported by trademarked, laboratory tested, innovative ingredients which are proven to strengthen follicles, stimulate hair growth and&nbsp;<strong>prevent hair loss in just 3 months!</strong></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The Megi range consists of four products:</span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Growth Stimulating Shampoo</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Fortifying, Nourishing Conditioner</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Advanced Hair Growth Supplement</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Growth Hair Stimulating Serum</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Specifically designed with trademarked, stimulating ingredients to restore hair thickness, help reduce hair shedding and thinning, whilst cultivating strong follicles and healthy hair.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Our Shampoo and Conditioner will stimulate and&nbsp;<strong>strengthen</strong>&nbsp;your hair follicle and&nbsp;<strong>repair</strong>, nourish your hair<strong>.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">A&nbsp;<strong>bespoke&nbsp;</strong>blend of&nbsp;<strong>vitamins</strong>&nbsp;and minerals provide the ultimate mix of nutrients required for hair growth from within.<br><br>Our Serum has an incredible&nbsp;<strong>powerhouse of actives</strong>, which stimulate hair growth by strengthening your follicles and nourishing your hair.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">This is the ultimate hair growth bundle, where&nbsp;<strong>maximum hair growth can be achieved.&nbsp;</strong><br></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span>15.00% commission on sale, payment via PayPal.</span></strong></span></p>",
